{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47086","headline":"句 · 齐己","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春晴游寺客，花落闭门僧。\n香传天下口。\n□贵火前名，角开香满室，炉动绿凝铛。\n园林将向夕，风雨更吹花相思坐溪石，□□□山风。\n夕照背高台，残钟残角催。\n五老峰前相见时，两无言语各扬眉。\n高人爱惜藏岩里，白甀封题寄火前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47086.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47086","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}